== Effects ==
* When held, Isaac has a 22.22% chance to be revived as {{c|???}} in the previous room. Can occur multiple times in the same run.

== Notes ==
* Resurrection items activate in a [[:Category:Revival items|set order]]. Broken Ankh is {{dlc|nr}} 7th / {{dlc|r}} 9th in this order after {{p|Soul of Lazarus}}, {{i|1up!}}, {{i|Dead Cat|nr}}, {{c|Lazarus|nr}}' inherent extra life ({{dlc|r}} swap the order of the previous two), {{i|Inner Child}}, {{i|Guppy's Collar}}, {{i|Lazarus' Rags}}, and {{i|Ankh}}.
* This trinket isn't affected by [[Luck]].
* Unlike {{i|Guppy's Collar}}, Broken Ankh will not display an extra life and question mark next to Isaac's hearts.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either increases chance to be revived as {{c|???}} to 33%. Having both to 50%.
* {{c|Tainted ???}}: Revived as Tainted ??? instead of ???.

